<title>BELGIUM: Powerfin 1996 net profit unchanged.</title>
<headline>Powerfin 1996 net profit unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in billions of francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net		  7.71    vs    7.71</p>
<p>    Turnover		  12.92    vs    4.91</p>
<p>    Net div/share	  121	 vs  115</p>
<p>NOTE - Powerfin is the international energy unit of Belgian utility Tractebel. Tractebel is a unit of Belgian holding company Societe Generale de Belgique SA (SGB), itself a unit of French Cie de Suez.  </p>
<p>NOTE - The company said turnover rose on the back of new projects abroad. Profit held steady as a result of the financing and development costs and goodwill depreciation related to the new foreign acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
